            <div xml:id="m-3ef77936-add3-4bf3-a93c-b264a06bd19f">
              <lg xml:id="m-b1f8d8da-ff5d-4db1-a0d2-a8d5e29fa30e">
                <l xml:id="m-50037fce-6936-4fd8-8d5b-22e3755e9c0a" facs="#m-9166c187-239b-4855-ab88-ba49375759f7" label="text-like">and Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-30d579e0-8fb5-403e-b836-b9bda8f14f4f" facs="#m-265aa7f4-2503-400d-8418-f7fbdd8b1bb9" label="ambiguous">si7</l><l xml:id="m-b34ec035-5a4e-4ee3-9c72-2660830ff371" facs="#m-6eba6ccd-781a-4c49-a849-67d57d5052d9" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú- ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a5a4817-e45a-45a4-b6b3-ecbc50853361" facs="#m-9dc2be14-e731-474f-ad06-d403ed43e0a7" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Exsultá-te jústi in</l><l xml:id="m-ef81e10e-e2e2-44c8-ae59-b17e0e6e6b1d" facs="#m-0de97a11-5c7e-49bf-98d6-1f06aa7cdbe7" label="lyrics-like">Dómino: "réctos décet collaudá-ti-o. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-ead197ab-a7f7-4776-ba00-e1d5012d076d" facs="#m-ebec15db-16b8-4e2b-b853-8d40e94753a8" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-e16f0319-65b7-4da7-b7d3-74783889018a" facs="#m-786f2dab-00e5-49d5-ab5c-d2dfabe71c4e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-9ef98df9-17e0-4bda-8d6f-7f5375963279" facs="#m-73c396d4-9140-4c11-b305-81c682bf9349" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui in Filii tui humilitáte, l tis eripuisti cásibus, gáudiis fácias</l><l xml:id="m-ad10689c-2634-42df-9b26-bc8530f22c26" facs="#m-c2fa64d4-1388-4b50-b6a3-3128c06d41c9" label="lyrics-like">A jacéntem mundum erexisti:</l><l xml:id="m-dfefdbed-08ad-44e3-a0e6-81536b0e3269" facs="#m-6057feeb-cbb7-4c94-9867-a6bd1a333be5" label="lyrics-like">pérfrui sempitérnis. Per eúmdem</l><l xml:id="m-ffd40434-51a7-44f5-92d8-6e373bcb2aba" facs="#m-a278ab97-665a-4a96-9668-c8114009367c" label="lyrics-like">fidélibus tuis perpétuam concéde</l><l xml:id="m-0670b509-0fc7-439f-9f3a-ac644d84d14f" facs="#m-3a2fe240-25a6-40c4-9a8e-e4bfc4d76a3d" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7e981bae-8d97-4a01-b3ad-11095481a46f" facs="#m-dc390ac2-535f-47ba-978d-042d4ebbf595" label="lyrics-like">laetítiam; “ ut quos perpétuae mor¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed842dca-490a-4ac8-bdfe-774ceee92405" facs="#m-efe6e721-e788-4784-b6de-e4e81b9fe18f" label="text-like">2. of our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-0b3ea532-0a55-4a75-8aa0-3298537f307d" facs="#m-7ea8a063-d77c-4b18-9650-886b63921590" label="lyrics-like">VOncéde nos fámulos tuos, quaé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1b6a7bc-7c72-418c-99ae-e681b48c8670" facs="#m-03657df4-230e-49b9-ad64-228237eea1ff" label="lyrics-like">Virginis intercessióne, a praesénti</l><l xml:id="m-c1b0d470-dd29-4e51-90e7-52d1458bf57a" facs="#m-a571c7b2-fc39-47aa-b590-b761b6c8b055" label="lyrics-like">liberári tristitia, et aetérna pérfrui</l><l xml:id="m-e4de3657-e428-43d4-9849-a2b828fd5519" facs="#m-c3f6cbd2-573b-467b-9fde-24b7c3e46647" label="lyrics-like">U sumus Dómine Deus, perpétua</l><l xml:id="m-fba33fbf-5df2-4b74-8ccd-8a20b2fc7693" facs="#m-3563335a-c36b-473e-869b-ae59daa00793" label="ambiguous">lactitia.</l><l xml:id="m-2ad958f4-3df8-4d24-90da-e21e610cad92" facs="#m-171122f2-f6cb-4a5f-9a08-fb543075ed4a" label="lyrics-like">mentis et córporis sanitâte gaudére:</l><l xml:id="m-d5173f25-3ceb-4b21-95e5-7b6d75ca1de0" facs="#m-8ad48ced-c0df-48c3-8757-f23d920895aa" label="lyrics-like">et gloriósa beátae Mariae semper</l><l xml:id="m-32adeeec-28f0-44e1-8a49-c5f94aaa426d" facs="#m-183d0a25-a8d0-41c1-b1b6-efb7db55be9d" label="text-like">3. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 819.</l><l xml:id="m-03738f67-a633-4161-b69a-10a1e85406a0" facs="#m-28505aec-4ec0-47af-a17a-f2d4fee55275" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Petri Apostoli. 1. Petr. 2. a.</l><l xml:id="m-0a30d7d4-2619-459d-ae02-2249ace11a91" facs="#m-f85a9012-da62-4749-8bd7-a9e00237cbfd" label="ambiguous">vArissimi : Christus passus est pro</l><l xml:id="m-cf91bf85-0378-4a6b-8c74-fd5f9e1df451" facs="#m-6cc03375-4bbf-40a9-aad9-c22e6f5867d9" label="lyrics-like">ste: qui peccáta nostra ipse pértulit</l><l xml:id="m-9825bf26-f2c1-4f29-8087-5824ae405934" facs="#m-ead584a4-c73d-46e1-ad0b-eefe9a3da349" label="lyrics-like">in córpore suo super lignum: ut</l><l xml:id="m-c01aed44-1dbf-41ad-86a0-58427bc2eda1" facs="#m-421d504e-931d-4ea3-9c84-89df3613fd78" label="lyrics-like">Lnobis, vobis relinquens exém¬</l><l xml:id="m-2cbde5a0-44a7-467c-bc36-a4f8292a25a9" facs="#m-063202f2-b43c-4357-97c3-37c1a00edfff" label="lyrics-like">peccátis mórtui, justitiae vivámus:</l><l xml:id="m-91be75b3-186f-43fa-af9b-2ab17fda2f1f" facs="#m-9157914e-efab-4907-9aee-1044e5278309" label="lyrics-like">plum, ut sequámini vestigia ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-c6ce670f-0d99-4207-b929-efa737ed292e" facs="#m-4edc26b9-eae9-4ccc-a263-0d363d0734a3" label="lyrics-like">Qui peccátum non fecit, nec invén¬</l><l xml:id="m-e820dcee-9869-4a55-ae5a-396be12ac360" facs="#m-491502cd-0b62-4021-8a80-c6081216b516" label="lyrics-like">cujus livóre sanáti estis. Erátis enim</l><l xml:id="m-26a19dd9-a41c-4547-aa57-d48cc6ea9b1c" facs="#m-4009b462-a69b-4c02-8e3c-7c18e21d1267" label="lyrics-like">sicut oves errántes, sed convérsi</l><l xml:id="m-88798c94-b528-43dc-a9c6-3e3eb981f339" facs="#m-f00e1bd8-0224-4bb7-9419-819001aee082" label="ambiguous">tus est dolus in ore ejus: qui cum</l><l xml:id="m-e52715c7-dfd8-46b4-93a9-5de8dd1bb6b6" facs="#m-4231dd7b-4a2f-46f5-a84d-81129f7e4739" label="lyrics-like">estis nunc ad pastórem et episco¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6c84c4b-0570-43b9-85ca-ccfa2fa3f55e" facs="#m-cbe52918-8e92-4e05-be28-c96df0ca4bf9" label="lyrics-like">maledicerétur, non maledicébat:</l><l xml:id="m-b6bf72bc-c028-4678-80d2-545d9164374c" facs="#m-a094d696-8751-4a1d-a648-4731299bc866" label="lyrics-like">pum animárum vestrárum.</l><l xml:id="m-66411c3f-2153-421f-b39a-d167ccd30f8b" facs="#m-8c4506d8-cab0-48e6-b9d1-004381605f3e" label="lyrics-like">cum paterétur, non comminabátur:</l><l xml:id="m-6bc27e19-64f6-4ad0-9232-2c47c70afb2d" facs="#m-955b54e8-82bb-4bef-a2b0-68a5a645c63d" label="lyrics-like">tradébat autem judicánti se injú¬</l><l xml:id="m-95ff2595-bb42-48ea-8f63-a87909495cda" facs="#m-226a623c-1952-49a3-ba08-b7d45af93bef" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-5f6089c3-a1fb-454c-9be9-5b2e3985aa7b" facs="#m-6564ce4d-e3e7-4497-8691-0046ca59c858" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-4817af6b-e3d0-4945-8b83-21c30b58a9eb" facs="#m-bc8235fe-5949-4c85-af49-0639280d7c22" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-42abc8d0-a09b-4948-af2a-851802ee7c26" facs="#m-f67f900a-4f54-4728-8c51-1023a0521cc4" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.—ij.</l><l xml:id="m-04082ffe-648b-4754-bac6-71be5735e395" facs="#m-894c33f9-47c9-4721-ae19-44ea2aa00f61" label="lyrics-like">V. Cognovérunt</l><l xml:id="m-223ffd35-85a3-4af6-8e43-2a71ed2ee64c" facs="#m-0640e54e-8f57-4b0b-814f-6f75c45dae32" label="lyrics-like">di-scí-pu-li</l><l xml:id="m-74180b33-9b75-49b5-a1dd-e0ed8798cdac" facs="#m-b3834284-0c7f-4bd2-98c8-d83434fedaf3" label="lyrics-like">Dó-mi-num Jé-sum</l><l xml:id="m-e1d9b97a-440a-4439-bd9a-567c6a7a37b4" facs="#m-d51ac55a-1885-4269-98c5-870b4e223bb3" label="lyrics-like">pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1858a569-2d1d-4c05-9535-a7c9ba1b56e0" facs="#m-d004a841-5ba9-4b90-895d-fd04655e44d0" label="ambiguous">in fra-cti- 6-ne</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>